Rename the `__unused__` macro to `CTAGS_ATTR_UNUSED`.

`__unused__` collides with the attribute spelling used by modern system
headers (recent macOS SDKs; glibc 2.34+). Same fix as Universal Ctags and
Debian's use-conventional-unused-marker.patch.

